Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 650
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "cd /tmp/breadcalc-demo && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./breadcalc"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "p"
Sleep 1s
Escape
Type "c"
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms